diff --git a/packages/ops-operation-catalog/README.md b/packages/ops-operation-catalog/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6cca6b0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/ops-operation-catalog/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# ops-operation-catalog
+
+Compiles package-owned finite operation declarations into one deterministic,
+non-authority catalog for operator consoles such as `edits`.
+
+The package validates exact selection, package/obligation references, closed schemas,
+and output digests. It performs no work activation, worker execution, retry, cancel,
+canonical result write, provider discovery, shell execution, or mutable repository read.
+
+## Source identity
+
+The emitted manifest binds the clean Git commit and the Nix flake source NAR hash. The exact Git tree is recorded by the independent clean-clone build receipt; the derivation never inserts a fabricated tree SHA.
